  "description": "Achilles, warrior of legend, has swallowed the reality that his glory days are over. Now, he’s just Adrian, the physical therapist — and all he wants these days is his paycheck and the privacy to nurse his permanent limp in peace! But his quiet life is interrupted when his rowdy and adventurous new neighbor ends up being Harper, a super hot advice columnist and NuTuber with an uncanny ability to know what people are thinking. As the two clash, sparks fly; is it possible for a man who’s lived a thousand lifetimes to fall in love again? More pressingly, can Achilles survive being the influencer’s new camera guy?!\nSource: Tapas",
